@startuml SABER Benchmark Framework Architecture - Detailed

!theme plain
title SABER Benchmark Framework - Detailed Architecture

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor lightblue
    BorderColor black
    ArrowColor black
    FontSize 10
}

package "Benchmark Framework Core" {

    class BenchmarkManager {
        +domain: str
        +tasks: Dict[str, Task]
        +config_loader: BenchmarkConfigLoader
        +benchmark_config: Dict[str, Any]
        +active_benchmarks: Dict[str, BenchmarkSession]
        --
        +get_task(task_id): Task
        +get_subtask(task_id, subtask_id): SubTask
        +list_tasks(): List[Dict]
        +create_benchmark_session(session_id, task_ids): BenchmarkSession
        +start_benchmark(session_id, config): BenchmarkSession
        +advance_benchmark(session_id, completed_task_id, success): str?
        +get_benchmark_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_episode_config(task_id): Dict[str, Any]
        +list_benchmark_tasks(): List[Dict]
        +load_tasks_from_yaml(): void
    }

    class BenchmarkSession {
        +session_id: str
        +task_queue: List[str]
        +completed_tasks: List[str]
        +failed_tasks: List[str]
        +current_task_id: str?
        +current_episode_id: str?
        +created_at: datetime
        --
        +get_next_task(): str?
        +mark_task_completed(task_id: str): void
        +mark_task_failed(task_id: str): void
        +set_current_episode(episode_id: str): void
        +to_api_response(domain: str): Dict[str, Any]
        +is_complete(): bool
    }

    class BenchmarkConfigLoader {
        +domain: str
        --
        +load_tasks_from_file(): Dict[str, Task]
        +load_benchmark_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_allowed_executors(): List[str]
        +_parse_task(): Task
        +_parse_subtask(): SubTask
        +_parse_benchmark_config(): Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class Task {
        +task_id: str
        +domain: str
        +title: str
        +description: str
        +environment: Union[str, Dict[str, Any]]
        +allowed_executors: List[str]
        +initial_context: Dict[str, Any]
        +subtasks: List[SubTask]
        +benchmark_config: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        +add_subtask(): void
        +get_subtask_by_id(): SubTask?
        +is_complete(): bool
        +get_all_subtask_ids(): Set[str]
        +get_episode_attempts(): int
    }

    class SubTask {
        +subtask_id: str
        +task_id: str
        +title: str
        +description: str
        +objective: str
        --
        +is_dependent_on(): bool
    }
}

package "Episode Management" {

    class EpisodeManager {
        +active_episodes: Dict[str, Episode]
        --
        +start_episode(session_id, task_id, initial_context?): Episode
        +step(session_id, action, command_result): Step
        +end_episode(session_id, reason): Episode
        +reset_episode(session_id, task_id): Episode
        +get_episode_state(session_id): EpisodeState?
        +get_current_episode(session_id): Episode?
        +create_step(episode, action, response): Step
        +update_episode_state(episode, step): void
        +cleanup_session(session_id): void
    }

    class Episode {
        +episode_id: str
        +task_id: str
        +session_id: str
        +start_time: datetime
        +end_time: Optional[datetime]
        +state: EpisodeState
        +steps: List[Step]
        +context: Dict[str, Any]
        +metadata: Dict[str, Any]
        +completion_reason: Optional[str]
        --
        +add_step(): void
        +get_executed_commands(): List[str]
        +is_complete: bool (property)
        +duration: Optional[float] (property)
    }

    class Step {
        +step_number: int
        +timestamp: datetime
        +action: Action
        +response: Dict[str, Any]
        +context_snapshot: Dict[str, Any]
        +done: bool
    }

    class Action {
        +tool_name: str
        +parameters: Dict[str, Any]
        +timestamp: datetime
        +arguments: Optional[str]
    }

    enum EpisodeState {
        CREATED
        ACTIVE
        COMPLETED
        FAILED
        TIMEOUT
        RESET
    }
}

' Relationships
BenchmarkManager *-- BenchmarkConfigLoader
BenchmarkManager *-- Task
BenchmarkManager *-- BenchmarkSession

BenchmarkConfigLoader ..> Task : creates
BenchmarkConfigLoader ..> SubTask : creates

Task *-- SubTask

EpisodeManager *-- Episode
Episode *-- Step
Step *-- Action
Episode ..> EpisodeState

note top of BenchmarkManager
**Benchmark Orchestration Manager**
Enhanced to focus on benchmark orchestration and task queue management.
Manages BenchmarkSession objects that track task progression through episodes.
Coordinates automatic task advancement when episodes complete successfully.
Responsible for task configuration loading, lookup, and benchmark coordination.
Task objects now contain all execution configuration and benchmark settings.
end note

note top of BenchmarkSession
**Benchmark Task Queue Manager**
Manages the progression of tasks within a benchmark session.
Tracks current task, completed tasks, and failed tasks.
Provides clean API for task advancement and completion checking.
Eliminates need for complex session state management in other components.
end note

note top of Task
**Enhanced Task Definition with Benchmark Configuration**
Tasks now contain complete execution configuration including flexible environment specification,
allowed_executors, and benchmark-specific settings (episode_attempts).
Environment can be: string template reference, dict with granular config, or hybrid approach.
No longer requires separate calls to get execution configuration.
Contains all parameters needed by other SABER components including benchmark orchestration.
Subtasks are retained for informational purposes only.
end note

note top of EpisodeManager
**Episode Lifecycle Manager**
Manages RL-style episodes with gym-compatible interfaces.
Returns Step objects directly from step() method.
Handles episode state transitions and completion detection.
Single source of truth for episode operations.
end note

note top of BenchmarkConfigLoader
**YAML Configuration Loader with Benchmark Support**
Enhanced to load complete task configuration including execution parameters and benchmark settings.
Parses allowed_executors and episode_attempts from YAML and includes in Task objects.
Loads domain-level benchmark configuration for orchestration settings.
No dependency validation or progression logic.
Single responsibility: YAML parsing and complete Task object creation with benchmark data.
end note

note bottom of Episode
**RL Episode State**
Contains complete action-response history for RL training.
No subtask progression tracking or state management.
Provides properties for current state access.
Includes completion information and metadata.
end note

@enduml
